@title taking the blows meant for somebody else

  proteger <targets>
  desproteger <target>

While you are protecting somebody, the attacks aimed at them reach
you instead, as long as you are both in the same place and you are
still alive. The verbs are not translated yet.

Nobody can protect you without your leave: it only works on people
who have set their 'proteger' consent to yes. Anybody who has not
is reported as not wanting your protection.

You can name several at once. 'desproteger' undoes one.
